{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0183_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d8e7f605784ef4e2ee16c291384b046a74471d66ce8e6c8799e1e0a3669a91fc", "ja": "（新曲のプロモーションから劇場に戻る途中……\nやよいとふたりで、近くの海に立ち寄ってみた）", "zh": "（从新曲宣传活动回剧场的路上……\n和弥生两个人顺道去了附近的海边）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0183_1001_005yay", "source_sha256": "229edef58096c4181dc0c8d49388a1099da289079dfbaee773bf33c4d59ea900", "ja": "わぁっ、また来ちゃいました！\nんん～っ！　潮風が気持ちいいですーっ！", "zh": "哇，又来这里了！\n嗯嗯～！海风吹得好舒服啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0183_1002_p", "source_sha256": "136fe2a984f9e46719be10313acae0169d939dd8ae824294d5f7c1d0bac58250", "ja": "うん。この前来たときよりも波が穏やかで、\nまた違った感じもするな。", "zh": "嗯。比上次来的时候风浪更平缓，\n感觉也别有一番滋味呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0183_1003_005yay", "source_sha256": "835a9f2a197408e45a724d705829a9efb9c57b737a8a73d7f5478b6909808411", "ja": "とってもきれいですよね！\n宿題は終わったけど、また描きたくなっちゃったかも！", "zh": "真的很漂亮呢！\n虽然作业已经完成了，但好像又想画了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0183_1004_p", "source_sha256": "3f6e0114be82fbad14d4e067c9777cebeb4ac3a0d7de5043c691adb3b2422d17", "ja": "はは、いいな。描けたら、春香や響にも見せて\nあげたらどうかな。もちろん、俺にもな。", "zh": "哈哈，真不错。画好了的话，也给春香和响看看吧。当然，也要给我看看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0183_1005_005yay", "source_sha256": "2fd477f8399e4cc0dd7cf0682481cf7ddec475936419d0e40bc90aa872779049", "ja": "えへへ、わかりましたっ！\nこれからもどんどん描いて、もっと上手になりますね！", "zh": "嘿嘿，知道啦！\n今后我也会不断地画，变得更加擅长的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0183_1006_005yay", "source_sha256": "dc9d2df698a468f4f10cbd281099005dd5c275e01d0379fca8f9b0b711d78224", "ja": "ほんと、海ってなんかいいですよね。\n私、海を見てても全然飽きないんです！", "zh": "真的，大海总让人觉得很棒呢。\n我就算一直看着大海也完全不会腻！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0183_1007_005yay", "source_sha256": "b7e29b0c4eaf9007c04140aeb577ef1089d4c093dffc8b03ca8a0219d6c166ac", "ja": "風も気持ちいいし、すっごく落ち着くし！\n私も海の近くで生まれたかったなー。", "zh": "风吹着也很舒服，让人特别放松！要是我也出生在海边就好了——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0183_1008_p", "source_sha256": "ee3e9567dd3e97331e171f79b1638f195b331bcf40a4d636e8ea4629d6a5509a", "ja": "そうだな。海を見てると、\n心が洗われるというか、郷愁を誘うというか……。", "zh": "是啊。看着大海，怎么说呢，感觉心灵都被洗涤了，又或者说，会勾起乡愁……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0183_1009_005yay", "source_sha256": "cd69a05db80ce574e79b4d0fbfd11b3c2f0956d95329eae71c0cc7c97bd787e3", "ja": "……きょーしゅーってなんですか？", "zh": "……“乡愁”是什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0183_1010_p", "source_sha256": "6ab327284cdb513a0de1dd1494d8ca835e71311179d6d66a7f26c4991cab7286", "ja": "ああ、懐かしく感じるって意味だよ。", "zh": "啊，就是觉得很怀念的意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0183_1011_005yay", "source_sha256": "3df5029cf0cb0170538d62d628766e0e0e0fe72be4fc9b47e18e1eb16884a806", "ja": "懐かしく……？\nうっうー！　そうですよね！", "zh": "怀念……？\n呜呜！确实是这样呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0183_1012_005yay", "source_sha256": "f7e95bcd97d786316783d9acba54f9a72c4601307294c5926873df4c1275b85e", "ja": "私、海と関係ないところで育ったのに、\nなんだか海が懐かしいなーって思うんです！", "zh": "我明明是在跟大海没什么关系的地方长大的，\n却总觉得大海好怀念哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0183_1013_p", "source_sha256": "60f257a65248b9ed8a9cd95f0ddacad41f3b94aba8094cc89bdc4e06bbf1bf90", "ja": "不思議だよな。もしかすると、人間はみんな、\n生まれながらにして海の記憶があるのかもしれないな。", "zh": "真不可思议啊。说不定人类天生就拥有关于大海的记忆。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0183_1014_005yay", "source_sha256": "d8fb0388b8b568c3d0e23321d75640c6e5f6fc351ab323c3f84afba2e39bc4a4", "ja": "あ！　だからみんな、海が好きなんですね！\nナットクしましたー！", "zh": "啊！所以大家都喜欢大海啊！\n我明白了——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0183_1015_p", "source_sha256": "96534b4ca44d7b768682da6eba35351ae442f1542bc82bfa7b8195fc8ad8e592", "ja": "い、いや、もしかすると、って話で……。", "zh": "不、不是，我只是说也许有这种可能……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0183_1016_005yay", "source_sha256": "fa33dd2c14b73a02f1501621728e56a0a517f9d1ef805e60ff7362a5cc99be3f", "ja": "今度の曲も、みんな海が大好きだーって感じで\n歌ったら、もっと良くなるかも！", "zh": "下次的歌曲，要是也唱出“大家都最喜欢大海啦”的感觉，说不定会更好哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0183_1017_005yay", "source_sha256": "9e62eaecc7828697f9b79271f5158b06f1c28cf536c75c60f3f0316f02a3e500", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}！\nさっそく、劇場に帰ってレッスンしましょう！", "zh": "谢谢你，{$P$}！\n我们马上回剧场练习吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0183_1018_p", "source_sha256": "aed67be6fe1434d344f7f52d29b95760e99d6388751fa1f2c31194b3fdc3d04a", "ja": "……そうだな、きっとみんなが待ってる。\n劇場に戻ろうか！", "zh": "……说得对，大家肯定都在等我们了。\n回剧场去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0183_1019_p", "source_sha256": "609fc6d098af736162cafb0006b21a1ae49f023a36dcc6f6f3ddd1c53d144a0e", "ja": "（何気なく海に来てみたけれど、やよいにとって\n良い刺激になったようだな。今後も期待できそうだ！）", "zh": "（虽然只是随意来海边看看，但对弥生来说似乎成了很好的刺激。今后也值得期待了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
